                <div id="pgp-rise-tab3" class="content">

                    <div class="faqquestionWrap mb30" data-rel="tab-c-1">
                        <div class="left">
                            <p class="faqHeading">How many years of experience do applicants need
                                to be admitted?</p>

                            <img  src="https://images.mastersunion.link/uploads/25062025/v1/MainButton3.svg"
                                class="toggler" alt="Icon">
                        </div>
                        <p class="faqanswer font-16 font-grey13" id="tab-c-1">Applicants need a minimum of 5 years of
                            experience to apply for the programme. In case any applicant has lesser work experience,
                            feel free to reach out to the admissions team who will evaluate their profile and advise
                            accordingly.</p>
                    </div>

                    <div class="faqquestionWrap mb30" data-rel="tab-c-2">
                        <div class="left">
                            <p class="faqHeading">Is there an age limit for entry?</p>

                            <img  src="https://images.mastersunion.link/uploads/25062025/v1/MainButton3.svg"
                                class="toggler" alt="Icon">
                        </div>
                        <p class="faqanswer font-16 font-grey13" id="tab-c-2">There is no age limit for entry. However,
                            the programme is more suitable for candidates with experience of at least 5 years. If they
                            have less work experience, we encourage them to get in touch with the admissions team who
                            will evaluate their profile and advise them accordingly.</p>
                    </div>

                    {{!-- <div class="faqquestionWrap mb30" data-rel="tab-c-3">
